#: app/Hooks/actions.php:39
msgid "When an administrator connects an Instagram account, this site sends your site's admin URL, one-time login codes, and the connecting administrator's email address and display name to the WP Social Ninja connect service (connect.wpsocialninja.com), which stores the email address only if the administrator opts in to getting-started emails. The connect service does not store access tokens or IP addresses. Access tokens are renewed by this site directly with Instagram, not through the connect service. This site also sends the connected account's access token and user ID to the Instagram/Meta Graph API to fetch posts, profile information, and renew the access token."
msgstr ""

